# Knowledge-base source + parsed JSONs ship with the repo so the api
# image builds with a complete /app/data tree and the indexer has
# something to upsert. Three of the JSONs are hand-curated (no source
# script exists), the others are reproducible via scripts/import_*.py.
# Add explicit ignores here only for files that are genuinely local
# (e.g. eval dumps, cache).
